From 1b83022d8a5c7ee5c3bc5c80817425cf515debc3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vrisan Shah <vrisan@example.com>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 06:32:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Avatar customization v2: skin tone, body presets, 5 new
 cosmetic slots

- New migration 033: skin_tone, avatar_body_type, and equip columns for
  aura/headwear/eyewear/handheld/shelf_theme, widened slot check constraint,
  description column on cosmetic_items
- lib/character.ts: new slots, BODY_TYPE_*/SKIN_TONE_SWATCHES exports,
  resolveEquippedShelfTheme(), resolveAvatarBase()
- New route: app/api/kids/character/avatar (POST skin tone / body type)
- equip + admin cosmetics routes: VALID_SLOTS now derived from SLOT_LABELS
  instead of separately hardcoded lists
- CharacterCanvas: renders skin-toned body shape via CSS mask instead of
  a catalog 'body' item
- CharacterClient: adds skin tone + body type picker UI
- home + shelf pages: pass through skinTone/bodyType, shelf theme background
